      "message": "This argument is \u0027chip\u0027 because it originally supported two ports on a single PD MCU. In the near future we\u0027ll probably have similar configs (multiple ports on a single TCPC). I don\u0027t think we should change \u0027chip\u0027 to \u0027port\u0027, but you can leave a comment explaining that a given chip can have multiple ports.",
