        "id": 1000253
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-02T00:56:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another issue here - Is it reasonable for somebody to want to suspend or resume the PD task for a single port? If so, what about \"reset\"?\n\nI\u0027m thinking that we should split some of the functionality out so that commands which operate at port-level granularity begin with pd* and commands which operate at chip-level granularity begin with tcpc*. So we\u0027d move the \"reset\" command to \"tcpc reset\" or something.",
      "parentUuid": "71dd999f_8f219963",
